[1618.006, "o", "\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m bash submission/scripts/mutate.sh 400 2>&1 | tail -13\r\nsubmission/testbench/rtl_checker.sv:111: warning: Omitting $sdf_annotate() since specify blocks are being omitted.\r\nmutant 6 (reads without EN_blockRead): FAIL 11890 check(s) failed\r\nsubmission/testbench/rtl_checker.sv:111: warning: Omitting $sdf_annotate() since specify blocks are being omitted.\r\nmutant 7 (RDY_blockRead not reset): FAIL 1202 check(s) failed\r\nsubmission/testbench/rtl_checker.sv:111: warning: Omitting $sdf_annotate() since specify blocks are being omitted.\r\nmutant 8 (valid pipeline not reset): FAIL 5825 check(s) failed\r\nsubmission/testbench/rtl_checker.sv:111: warning: Omitting $sdf_annotate() since specify blocks are being omitted.\r\nmutant 9 (valid bit set by unaccepted pairs): FAIL 7987 check(s) failed\r\nsubmission/testbench/rtl_checker.sv:111: warning: Omitting $sdf_annotate() since specify blocks are being omitted.\r\nmutant 10 (wrong data source): FAIL 1818 check(s) failed\r\nsubmission/testbench/rtl_checker.sv:111: warning: Omitting $sdf_annotate() since specify blocks are being omitted.\r\nmutant 11 (EN_readMem held during drain): FAIL 2158 check(s) failed\r\nkilled 11 of 11 mutants\r\n"]
